  m_text: 'SECTION BUTTON PREVIEW

    Select Section Preview Controls and change Selected Section in the Inspector.

    Edit the original section prefab in Assets/Prefabs/UI. Internal RectTransforms are manual; the list arranges entire buttons.

    Save the prefab, return here, and scroll to inspect short/long Thai/English and selected/disabled samples. Play this scene for mouse/hover tests.

    No Production gameplay managers or data are used.'
